To build and run this folder in VS Code:

1. Open the repository workspace in VS Code.
2. Select Terminal > Run Task...
3. Choose "Run W02C01".

This task compiles Source/main.cpp and Source/Time.cpp together, using the
Header folder for ClockTime.h, then runs W02C01.exe. Do not use "Run C/C++
File" for this folder because it builds only the currently active source file.